	<skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Samoëns-Mont Buet Thrust designates the thrust of the Chaînes Subalpines Nappe onto the Morcles Nappe (both Lower Helvetic units) in the French Alps directly to the west of the Aiguilles Rouges Massif.</skos:definition>
